// LLAMP-SPEC v1 | CURRENT_DECISIONS
// task: Workflow Execution Context Debugger Completion | date: 2026-03-27

#what_changed
=workflow-engine.service.ts: contextSnapshot captured AFTER all context mutations (variables, workspace, trigger); emitted in workflow:execution:step WebSocket event
=workflow-execution.model.ts: ExecutionLogEntry.contextSnapshot?: Record<string,any> added to interface + Mongoose schema (Schema.Types.Mixed)
=packages/types/src/index.ts: WorkflowExecutionStepEvent.contextSnapshot?: Record<string,any>
=workflow.schema.ts: evaluateExpressionSchema (expression:string, executionId?:string); EvaluateExpressionDTO exported
=workflow.routes.ts: POST /workflows/:workflowId/evaluate-expression registered with zodBodyValidator + Swagger docs
=workflow.controller.ts: evaluateExpression() handler — fetches latest execution if no executionId; builds context from last step's contextSnapshot; calls resolveExpression()
=ContextDebugPanel.tsx: getContextVariables() reads from executionLog.last.contextSnapshot; Variables tab renders 3 color-coded sections (blue=variables, green=trigger, amber=workspace); Tester tab with 500ms debounce via useRef timer; cleanup on unmount; executionId prop added; handleExportLog() downloads JSON blob
=WorkflowToolbar.tsx: debugMessagesCount prop; Debug button wrapped in relative div; red badge shown when count > 0 AND !isDebugPanelOpen
=workflowSlice.ts: autoOpenDebugOnExecute reducer (sets isDebugPanelOpen=true); exported
=page.tsx (builder): debugMessagesCount={debugMessages.length}; executionId={currentExecutionId} to ContextDebugPanel; dispatch(autoOpenDebugOnExecute()) after executeWorkflow.unwrap() success

#tech_implications
~contextSnapshot adds ~1 Record<string,any> per log entry to WorkflowExecution MongoDB document — acceptable for 90-day TTL collection
~Expression evaluator is stateless — uses last execution context from DB, not live in-memory state
~autoOpenDebugOnExecute is one-way (panel opens, never auto-closes) — user closes manually
~Export Log: browser Blob API; URL.revokeObjectURL() called after download to prevent memory leak
~contextSnapshot NOT captured in error path — failed nodes lack context in export

#constraints
~Tester tab requires: workflowId saved + executionLog.length > 0 (at least one completed execution)
~Export Log button only rendered when executionLog.length > 0
~evaluate-expression endpoint throws NotFoundError if no execution exists for workflow
~Badge count does not reset when panel opens — only hidden; cleared by clearDebugMessages() action
